body:
Hi {{first_name}},

Great news — {{university}} has made you {{article}} {{decision_status_lower}} for your UCAS choice:

  Course        : {{course_name}}{{course_code_suffix}}
  Entry year    : {{entry_year}}
  Cycle         : {{cycle_year}}
  UCAS ID       : {{ucas_id}}

{{conditions_block}}

What to do next
---------------
  - Sign in to UCAS Track (track.ucas.com) — the offer will show up on your dashboard.
  - Decide whether to set this offer as your Firm or Insurance choice. UCAS publishes the reply deadline for your cycle.
  - If you'd like to discuss the offer, the course, or the conditions, reply to this email or contact the admissions team at {{contact_email}}.

Your sixth-form tutor and careers team can also help you weigh up your choices.

We hope to see you in {{entry_year}}.

The Admissions Team
{{university}}
